{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hi, Mr. ___. I'm Dr. ___, one of your doctors here. You came in last night with nausea and left flank pain. Can you tell me more about what happened?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah, I’ve had this left side pain for a couple days. Then last night I started throwing up. No fever though."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I see. Your nephrostomy tube was capped when you arrived. We uncapped it, and there was pus draining. That suggests an infection in your left kidney."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Oh great. Not again. That tube’s always causing trouble."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:07:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I understand. Your labs show your white count is up, and your kidney function is worse than usual. We’re starting you on meropenem for the infection."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:09:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve had that before. I hope it works. What about the tube?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:11:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re arranging for Interventional Radiology to replace it. It’s routine, but important to clear the blockage and treat the infection."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:13:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay. Just make sure they don’t let it stick out of the ileostomy again like last time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2145-08-14 11:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good point. The note says they’ll trim the tip to prevent that. We’ll confirm it’s done right."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2145-08-15 09:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. You had the nephrostomy tube exchange this morning. It went well. They found narrowing at the kidney and stricture near the ileostomy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2145-08-15 09:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So that’s why it was blocked? Is it fixed now?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2145-08-15 09:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, they put in a new stent. It’s draining well. We’ll keep you on antibiotics for about a week."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2145-08-15 09:36:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "And my kidney numbers? They were bad last time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2145-08-15 09:38:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your creatinine was 4.3 on admission. We’ll watch it closely. With treatment, it should improve."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2145-08-16 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your urine culture came back. It grew Stenotrophomonas. That’s why we’re using meropenem—it covers that bug."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2145-08-16 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Is that dangerous? I’ve never heard of it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2145-08-16 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s a resistant organism, but meropenem works well. We’ll finish the course and monitor."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2145-08-17 09:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re doing okay, but we noticed your sodium is low—125. Any idea why you might be drinking a lot of fluids?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2145-08-17 09:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve been thirsty. Drink water, juice, Gatorade. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2145-08-17 09:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "With your kidney disease, you can’t get rid of extra water easily. Too much can drop your sodium. We’ll ask you to limit to about 2 liters a day."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2145-08-17 09:21:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Two liters? That’s not much. But okay, I’ll try."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2145-08-18 10:10:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your sodium is up to 128. Good job on the fluid restriction. We’ll keep watching it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2145-08-18 10:12:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Any change in the kidney numbers?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2145-08-18 10:14:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Creatinine is down to 3.0. That’s a good sign the infection and blockage are improving."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2145-08-19 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re planning a trial to cap your nephrostomy tube tomorrow. If you don’t have pain or swelling, we can discharge soon after."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2145-08-19 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "What if it doesn’t work? Last time it got blocked again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2145-08-19 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll monitor closely. If there’s any issue, we’ll unclog or replace it. But the new stent should help."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2145-08-20 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We capped the tube this morning. You’ve had no pain so far—that’s a good sign."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2145-08-20 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I feel okay. No pain. But I’m nervous."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2145-08-20 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll keep checking your kidney function and scan if needed. If all goes well, you could go home tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2145-08-21 09:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I’m sorry, but your creatinine went up after capping. We had to unclog the tube. It’s now draining again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2145-08-21 09:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So it’s blocked again? Why?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2145-08-21 09:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The stent may have gotten clogged. We’re scheduling another exchange to make sure it’s working."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2145-08-22 14:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You had the second stent exchange today. They confirmed the old one was occluded. The new one is in place and draining well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2145-08-22 14:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will this one last longer?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2145-08-22 14:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s the same type, but we’ll monitor. You’ll need routine changes every three months."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2145-08-23 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your urine culture today showed yeast. It’s likely not causing infection, but we’ll watch for symptoms."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2145-08-23 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Do I need treatment?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2145-08-23 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Not right now. It’s common with catheters. We’ll keep the area clean and monitor."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2145-08-24 09:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your sodium is now 133—back to normal. Great job limiting fluids."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2145-08-24 09:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I still feel thirsty, but I’m sticking to it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2145-08-24 09:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s important. Your kidney function is also improving—creatinine is 2.8."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2145-08-25 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re going to try capping the tube again. This time, we’ll watch even more closely."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2145-08-25 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Hope it works. I just want to go home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2145-08-26 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good news—you passed the cap trial. No rise in creatinine, no pain. We’re planning discharge in a couple days."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2145-08-26 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s a relief. What do I need to do at home?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2145-08-26 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Continue all your usual meds. Limit fluids to under 2 liters. Watch for fever, pain, or drainage changes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2145-08-27 10:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your nephrologist recommended vein mapping for future dialysis access. They’d like to see you in clinic."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2145-08-27 10:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I don’t want that. My kidneys are bad, but I’m not ready for dialysis talks."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2145-08-27 10:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I understand. We’ll note your decision. But it’s important to plan ahead as your CKD progresses."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2145-08-28 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re finalizing your discharge. You’ll go home tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2145-08-28 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "What about the antibiotics?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2145-08-28 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ve completed the 7-day course. No need for more. Just keep an eye on symptoms."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Today’s the day. You’re doing well—no pain, stable labs, tube capped and working."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Great. What about follow-up?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Urology will schedule your next tube exchange in three months. Primary care and nephrology will see you soon."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "And the lung nodule from last time?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You need a follow-up CT in three months. Your PCP will arrange that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:10:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay. Thanks for everything."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2145-08-29 10:12:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Remember—fluids under 2 liters, watch for fever or pain, and keep your appointments."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2145-08-30 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just checking in before discharge. How are you feeling?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2145-08-30 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Good. Ready to go home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2145-08-30 09:03:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ve added ondansetron for nausea, just in case. Take it as needed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2145-08-30 09:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thanks. I’ll keep it handy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2145-08-31 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Discharge is set for tomorrow. Any last questions?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2145-08-31 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "No, I think we covered it. Thanks again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2145-09-01 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. You’re cleared to go home. We’ll see you in follow-up."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2145-09-01 08:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Appreciate all the help."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2145-09-01 08:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Take care. Call if you have fever, pain, or nausea that won’t go away."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2145-09-01 08:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 71,
      "time": "2145-09-01 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just a final check. You’re alert, pain is stable, vitals normal. Discharge is confirmed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 72,
      "time": "2145-09-01 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 73,
      "time": "2145-09-01 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Nursing is finalizing your meds and instructions. You’ll get a copy to take home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 74,
      "time": "2145-09-01 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Good. I’ll keep it with me."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 75,
      "time": "2145-09-01 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Transport is here. Take care, and we’ll see you in clinic."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 76,
      "time": "2145-09-01 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thanks, doc. Stay well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 77,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re officially discharged. Keep up the good work with fluids and follow-up."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 78,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. Appreciate everything."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 79,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "One last thing—your discharge summary says to limit fluids to less than 2 liters daily. Please stick to that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 80,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Got it. Water, juice, Gatorade—all under 2 liters."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 81,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Exactly. And call if anything changes. Take care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 82,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:36:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will do. Thanks again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 83,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:38:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Have a safe trip home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 84,
      "time": "2145-09-01 12:40:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. See you in clinic."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 85,
      "time": "2145-09-01 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Take care, Mr. ___. We’re here if you need us."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2145-08-14 10:56:00",
    "admission_end": "2145-09-01 13:40:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "Mr. ___ was admitted with nausea and left flank pain, found to have a left-sided pyelonephritis due to a malfunctioning nephrostomy tube. He had leukocytosis and acute-on-chronic kidney injury. The tube was draining pus, and urine culture grew Stenotrophomonas maltophilia, treated with a 7-day course of meropenem. He underwent two nephrostomy tube exchanges due to occlusion, with the second allowing successful capping. Hyponatremia developed due to excessive fluid intake and CKD, improving with fluid restriction to less than 2 liters daily. Renal function improved, with creatinine decreasing from 4.3 to 2.8. He passed the capping trial, was discharged home, and advised to follow up with urology, nephrology, and primary care, including a repeat CT for a known lung nodule.",
    "problems": [
      "Pyelonephritis, unspecified",
      "Mechanical complication due to other implant and internal device, not elsewhere classified",
      "Acute kidney failure, unspecified",
      "Chronic kidney disease, Stage IV (severe)",
      "Hyponatremia",
      "Hydronephrosis",
      "Neurogenic bladder NOS",
      "Paraplegia",
      "Anemia in chronic kidney disease",
      "Epilepsy, unspecified, without mention of intractable epilepsy",
      "Anxiety state, unspecified",
      "Depressive disorder, not elsewhere classified",
      "Backache, unspecified",
      "Other chronic pain",
      "Esophageal reflux",
      "Ileostomy status",
      "Other artificial opening of urinary tract status"
    ]
  }
}
